Z||000000||AkursedX||10-20-2001||01:56 PM||||Anyone have anyidea what would of caused the catalyst inside my catalytic converter to melt??<P>Needless to say, My car has been running like utter crap the past few weeks.  But it will be better now since I just hollowed out the cat and threw it back on.  <P>But, does anyone have any idea on what could of caused this in the 1st place?  My O2 sensor is only 5 months old, all my ignition components are in great shape, expect for numerous failed ignition coils  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/mad.gif">  Besides that, I don't know what else could of caused it.  And feedback would be appreciated  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>------------------<BR><BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sigpic2_2.jpg"> ||||reg||5
Z||000001||Mark||10-20-2001||05:12 PM||||Likely an ignition problem, like a bad plug, wire or coil.||||reg||1
