Z||000007||Rich86GT||10-22-2001||09:00 PM||||My 86 GT, V6, 5 speed, 147,000 miles, had a similar intermittent problem where it would not rev above 2500 rpm (even floored), but still had good power below 2000 rpm.  When this happened, the O2 sensor (measured with a voltmeter) indicated a rich mixture.  The exhaust would be red hot. Never have found the problem; but I suspected injectors, wiring harness, or fuel pressure. It hasn't reoccured for 6 months. <BR>||||reg||1
